<template>
  <main ref="scrollArea" class="design-page">
    <header class="design-nav"><RouterLink to="/">← 返回游戏首页</RouterLink><span>斗罗大陆 · 数值策划作品</span><button @click="downloadCsv">导出完整数值表 ↓</button></header>
    <div class="design-content">
      <section class="hero">
        <p class="eyebrow">DESIGN NOTES / 当前可玩版本 / 2026.10</p><h1>从觉醒到终局，<br>拆解一整局的数值。</h1>
        <p class="lead">用规则解释成长，用选择连接系统，用验证修正问题。这里把游戏流程、当前配置、交互计算与修复证据放在一起，展示一个文字 RPG 的数值设计过程。</p>
        <div class="hero-actions"><RouterLink to="/create" class="primary">体验角色创建 →</RouterLink><button @click="select('fixes')">先看本轮修复 ↗</button><button @click="select('growth')">查看成长曲线 ↓</button></div>
        <div class="overview"><div><strong>1—100</strong><span>成长等级</span></div><div><strong>{{ progression.gates.length }} 个</strong><span>魂环门槛</span></div><div><strong>{{ progression.mainStory.length }} 段</strong><span>主线里程碑</span></div><div><strong>4 条</strong><span>主结局分支</span></div></div>
      </section>
      <section class="flow-section" aria-labelledby="flow-title">
        <div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">LIFECYCLE / 流程 × 数据</p><h2 id="flow-title">沿着一局冒险，查看数据怎样流动</h2></div><span class="hint">点击节点展开图表与讲解</span></div>
        <LifecycleFlow :active="active" @select="select"/>
        <p class="fine">循环：探索/主线 → 战斗 → 结算 → 等级/魂环/资源 → 构筑与恢复 → 再探索。存档贯穿全程；最终决战胜利后结束本周目。</p>
      </section>
      <section ref="explorer" class="explorer" aria-labelledby="explorer-title">
        <nav class="system-nav" aria-label="数值分析系统"><button v-for="tab in tabs" :key="tab.id" :aria-pressed="active===tab.id" :class="{chosen:active===tab.id}" @click="select(tab.id,false)">{{ tab.name }}</button></nav>
        <div class="analysis-heading"><p class="eyebrow">{{ String(tabs.findIndex(t=>t.id===active)+1).padStart(2,'0') }} / {{ tabs.find(t=>t.id===active)?.name }}</p><h2 id="explorer-title">{{ teaching.title }}</h2><div class="io-strip"><span><small>输入</small>{{ teaching.input }}</span><b aria-hidden="true">→</b><span><small>输出</small>{{ teaching.output }}</span></div></div>

        <div v-if="active==='creation'" class="domain-content">
          <AnalysisChart title="品质概率：普通出身与武魂城对照" unit="% / 单次觉醒" :rows="tierRows" :series="[{key:'base',name:'普通出身'},{key:'boosted',name:'武魂城'}]" description="先抽基础品质，再独立判定是否上调一档。档内各武魂等概率。"/>
          <div class="two-col"><AnalysisChart title="自然获得神级的累计概率" unit="%" kind="line" :rows="pityRows" label-key="draw" :series="[{key:'base',name:'普通出身'},{key:'boosted',name:'武魂城'}]" description="前49次独立抽样；第50次非神级时开放自选神级，不计为自然抽中。"/><div class="insight"><p class="eyebrow">概率读法</p><strong>{{ percent(creation.pity.naturalGodBeforePity.baseProbability) }} / {{ percent(creation.pity.naturalGodBeforePity.recommendedProbability) }}</strong><p>前49次自然出神的概率（普通 / 武魂城）。保底保证第50次可取得神级，不保证前49次已抽中。</p><p>按出身分别累计次数，开新周目重置草稿。重复觉醒不收费。</p></div></div>
          <AnalysisTable caption="四种出身：品质倾向与初始属性" :rows="creation.origins" :columns="[{key:'name',label:'出身'},{key:'bonus',label:'定位'},{key:'stats',label:'固定属性',format:bonusText},{key:'qualityBoost',label:'品质升档',format:v=>v?'非神级结果10%上调一档':'无'}]"/>
          <AnalysisTable caption="品质池与生成资质区间" :rows="creation.quality" :columns="[{key:'tier',label:'品质',format:tierName},{key:'count',label:'档内武魂数'},{key:'generatedTalentRange',label:'普通出身资质',format:v=>`${v.min}—${v.max}`},{key:'recommendedOriginGeneratedRange',label:'武魂城资质',format:v=>`${v.min}—${v.max}`}]"/><p class="fine">顶级武魂还有独立10%概率取100资质。神级恒为100。</p>
        </div>
        <div v-else-if="active==='growth'" class="domain-content">
          <div class="inline-controls"><label for="level-slider">观察等级 <strong>Lv.{{ level }}</strong><input id="level-slider" v-model.number="level" type="range" min="1" max="99"></label><label for="curve-mode">曲线口径<select id="curve-mode" v-model="curveMode"><option value="required">单级需求</option><option value="cumulative">从Lv1累计需求</option></select></label></div>
          <AnalysisChart :title="curveMode==='required'?'单级升级经验与无减免参照':'从Lv1升级到对应下一级的累计经验'" unit="经验" kind="line" :rows="growth" label-key="level" :series="curveMode==='required'?[{key:'required',name:'当前规则'},{key:'baseline',name:'无减免参照'}]:[{key:'cumulative',name:'当前累计'},{key:'baselineCumulative',name:'参照累计'}]" description="横轴当前等级1—99，最后一点是99→100。无减免线是数学参照，不代表本次修改前的版本。"/>
          <div class="metric-row"><div><small>Lv.{{ level }} → {{ level+1 }}</small><strong>{{ format(selectedGrowth.required) }}</strong><span>单级经验</span></div><div><small>从Lv1起累计</small><strong>{{ format(selectedGrowth.cumulative) }}</strong><span>升级到Lv.{{ level+1 }}</span></div><div><small>阶段系数</small><strong>{{ percent(selectedGrowth.multiplier) }}</strong><span>相对无减免幂函数</span></div></div>
          <div class="estimate"><label for="action-exp">假设每次行动基础经验<input id="action-exp" v-model.number="actionExp" type="number" min="1" max="100000"></label><p>零经验起步，理论需 <strong>{{ format(Math.ceil(selectedGrowth.required / Math.max(1,Number(actionExp)||1))) }}</strong> 次行动升级。不含加成、猎环、旅行和失败恢复。</p></div>
          <div class="gate-timeline"><div v-for="g in progression.gates" :key="g.level"><strong>{{ g.level }}级</strong><span>第{{ g.ring }}魂环</span><small>暂存上限 {{ format(Math.round(growth[g.level-1].required*1.5)) }}</small></div></div>
          <AnalysisTable caption="主线、等级与目的地：15个实际入口" :rows="storyRows" :columns="[{key:'order',label:'顺序'},{key:'name',label:'里程碑'},{key:'minLevel',label:'最低等级'},{key:'targetName',label:'目的地'}]"/>
        </div>
        <div v-else-if="active==='content'" class="domain-content">
          <label class="range-block" for="content-level">静态快照等级 <strong>Lv.{{ contentLevel }} · {{ phaseNames[content.phase] }}</strong><input id="content-level" v-model.number="contentLevel" type="range" min="1" max="100"></label><p class="method">{{ content.explanation }}</p>
          <AnalysisChart title="地点可匹配的随机事件数量" unit="条事件 / 地点" :rows="content.locationDensity.map(r=>({...r,name:r.location}))" :series="[{key:'count',name:'满足静态条件'}]" description="全局事件可能匹配多个地点，各柱不能相加当作事件总量。未计运行时去重、冷却与自定义函数条件。"/>
          <AnalysisTable caption="阶段奖励分布：选项基础奖励，非玩家收入" :rows="phaseRewards" :columns="[{key:'name',label:'阶段'},{key:'range',label:'等级区间'},{key:'expMax',label:'最高经验'},{key:'expMean',label:'平均经验'},{key:'goldMax',label:'最高金币'},{key:'samples',label:'等级×选项样本数'}]"/>
          <p class="fine">同一事件在多个等级符合资格时重复计入；每个“等级×选项”等权，非唯一选项并集，也非按事件权重计算的期望收益。</p>
          <details><summary>展开武魂专属内容投放（{{ content.spiritSpecificJsonEvents.total }}条JSON配置）</summary><AnalysisTable caption="当前等级：逐个武魂的专属事件覆盖" :rows="content.spiritSpecificJsonEvents.bySpirit" :columns="[{key:'spiritName',label:'武魂'},{key:'count',label:'合格专属事件数'},{key:'eventIds',label:'事件编号'}]"/></details>
          <AnalysisChart title="内容来源与独立入口规模" unit="条配置（来源有包含关系）" :rows="[{name:'合并基础池',value:content.catalog.configuredEvents},{name:'其中武魂JSON',value:content.catalog.spiritJson},{name:'独立主线',value:content.catalog.mainStory},{name:'正式猎环',value:content.catalog.ringHunts},{name:'地点专属',value:content.catalog.local},{name:'动态事件',value:content.catalog.dynamic},{name:'链式事件',value:content.catalog.chained}]" :series="[{key:'value',name:'配置数量'}]" description="武魂JSON、主线和猎环可能包含在基础池配置中，但入口分开；不能将各柱相加。动态事件有35%入口判定，随机链式入口25%，还要先满足候选条件。"/>
          <details><summary>地点探索：模式、等级与奖励投放</summary><AnalysisTable caption="地点专属事件全部配置" :rows="content.localEvents" :columns="[{key:'name',label:'事件'},{key:'location',label:'地点'},{key:'mode',label:'行动模式'},{key:'minLevel',label:'最低等级'},{key:'maxExp',label:'最高选项经验'}]"/></details>
          <details><summary>动态事件：一次性、冷却与状态条件</summary><AnalysisTable caption="动态事件：不计入普通静态事件密度" :rows="content.dynamicEvents" :columns="[{key:'name',label:'事件'},{key:'once',label:'一次性',format:v=>v?'是':'否'},{key:'cooldown',label:'冷却/行动'},{key:'weight',label:'候选权重'},{key:'condition',label:'触发条件（G为角色/世界快照）'}]"/></details>
          <details><summary>链式事件：前置与后续节点</summary><AnalysisTable caption="全部链式节点" :rows="content.chainedEvents" :columns="[{key:'name',label:'节点'},{key:'minLevel',label:'最低等级'},{key:'requires',label:'前置'},{key:'next',label:'选项指向'}]"/></details>
          <div class="insight"><h3>怎样继续检查奖励跨度</h3><p>按等级与地点筛选，再把选项经验除以该级需求，找一次跨多级的来源；检查是否只触发一次、有战斗/资源成本、被魂环门槛截断。异常需要结合实际路径确认，不能只按最大值直接砍奖励。</p></div>
        </div>
        <div v-else-if="active==='map'" class="domain-content">
          <p class="method">点击地点查看成本；连线为配置普通连接。隐藏地点还有额外发现条件。</p>
          <div class="map-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="地点连接图，可横向滚动"><div class="map-canvas" :style="{height:mapHeight+'px'}"><svg :viewBox="`0 0 900 ${mapHeight}`" aria-hidden="true"><line v-for="(edge,i) in mapEdges" :key="i" :x1="mapPosition(edge.a).x+74" :y1="mapPosition(edge.a).y+28" :x2="mapPosition(edge.b).x+74" :y2="mapPosition(edge.b).y+28" :class="{related:edge.a===mapIndex||edge.b===mapIndex}"/></svg><button v-for="(loc,i) in map.locations" :key="loc.id" :style="{left:mapPosition(i).x+'px',top:mapPosition(i).y+'px'}" :class="{chosen:mapIndex===i}" :aria-pressed="mapIndex===i" @click="mapIndex=i"><strong>{{ loc.name }}</strong><small>Lv.{{ loc.unlockedLevel||1 }}</small></button></div></div>
          <div class="metric-row"><div><small>{{ selectedLocation.name }} · 普通旅行</small><strong>{{ selectedLocation.normalDays }} 天</strong><span>{{ selectedLocation.normalCost }}金 · {{ selectedLocation.normalDays*8 }}时段 · 32%遇敌</span></div><div><small>已访问后 · 快速旅行</small><strong>{{ selectedLocation.fastDays }} 天</strong><span>{{ selectedLocation.fastCost }}金 · {{ selectedLocation.fastDays*8 }}时段 · 8%遇敌</span></div><div><small>解锁门槛</small><strong>Lv.{{ selectedLocation.unlockedLevel||1 }}</strong><span>仍需满足连接或已访问条件</span></div></div>
          <AnalysisChart title="各地点的普通与快速旅行时长" unit="游戏日" :rows="map.locations" :series="[{key:'normalDays',name:'普通'},{key:'fastDays',name:'已访问后快速'}]"/>
          <AnalysisChart title="旅行遭遇：全类型解锁后的单趟概率" unit="% / 单趟旅行" :rows="map.travelEncounters.map(r=>({...r,name:travelNames[r.id],normal:r.normalProbability*100,fast:r.fastProbability*100}))" :series="[{key:'normal',name:'普通旅行'},{key:'fast',name:'快速旅行'}]" description="Lv15起七类均符合等级条件，按权重合计95归一化，再乘普通32%/快速8%的遭遇入口概率。低等级需剔除未解锁类型后重新归一化；遭遇不一定是战斗。"/>
          <AnalysisTable caption="七种旅行遭遇：等级、权重与类型" :rows="map.travelEncounters" :columns="[{key:'id',label:'遭遇',format:v=>travelNames[v]},{key:'minLevel',label:'最低等级'},{key:'type',label:'类型',format:v=>({battle:'战斗',merchant:'行商',reward:'资源',event:'事件'}[v])},{key:'weight',label:'权重'},{key:'text',label:'情境'}]"/>
          <AnalysisTable caption="隐藏地点发现条件：Lv1新角色参考快照" :rows="map.hiddenClues" :columns="[{key:'name',label:'秘境'},{key:'clue',label:'线索'},{key:'progress',label:'发现条件',format:v=>v.map(r=>r.label).join('；')},{key:'nextStep',label:'下一步'}]"/>
          <AnalysisTable caption="完整地点成本与连接" :rows="map.locations" :columns="[{key:'name',label:'地点'},{key:'unlockedLevel',label:'解锁等级'},{key:'normalCost',label:'普通/金币'},{key:'fastCost',label:'快速/金币'},{key:'connectedTo',label:'连接',format:v=>(v||[]).map(id=>map.locations.find(l=>l.id===id)?.name||id).join(' / ')}]"/>
        </div>
        <div v-else-if="active==='combat'" class="domain-content">
          <div class="difficulty-grid"><button v-for="[key,preset] in Object.entries(presets)" :key="key" :class="{chosen:difficulty===key}" :aria-pressed="difficulty===key" @click="difficulty=key"><span>{{ difficultyNames[key] }}</span><strong>{{ preset.rounds }} 次</strong><small>目标出手 · 损耗参数{{ percent(preset.loss) }}</small></button></div>
          <label class="range-block" for="attack-slider">参照角色攻击力 <strong>{{ attack }}</strong><input id="attack-slider" v-model.number="attack" type="range" min="20" max="300" step="10"></label><p class="fine">固定玩家防御60、生命1000、速度30；均衡型敌人、无魂技，生成浮动取中值。这是生成模型，不是胜率模拟。</p>
          <div class="metric-row"><div><small>敌方生命</small><strong data-testid="enemy-hp">{{ preview.enemy.maxHp }}</strong></div><div><small>敌方攻击 / 防御</small><strong>{{ preview.enemy.attack }} / {{ preview.enemy.defense }}</strong></div><div><small>敌方速度</small><strong>{{ preview.enemy.speed }}</strong></div></div>
          <div class="formula">伤害由攻击×[0.88,1.12]浮动减有效防御×0.48，再乘元素、暴击、连击与状态倍率，最终取整并保证至少1点。实际函数与回合共同决定结果。</div>
          <div class="table-scroll"><table class="element-table"><caption>元素克制矩阵 · 行攻击，列防守</caption><thead><tr><th>攻↓ 守→</th><th v-for="e in elementKeys" :key="e">{{ elements[e] }}</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="a in elementKeys" :key="a"><th>{{ elements[a] }}</th><td v-for="b in elementKeys" :key="b" :class="multiplier(a,b)>1?'strong-cell':multiplier(a,b)<1?'weak-cell':''">{{ multiplier(a,b) }}</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
          <div class="status-grid"><div v-for="(s,key) in statuses" :key="key"><span>{{ s.icon }} {{ s.name }}</span><small>{{ s.harmful?'负面状态':'增益状态' }}</small></div></div><div class="mini-flow"><span>行动可用性</span><b>→</b><span>消耗魂力/道具</span><b>→</b><span>伤害/状态/追击</span><b>→</b><span>死亡与首领阶段</span><b>→</b><span>下一回合或一次结算</span></div>
        </div>
        <div v-else-if="active==='rings'" class="domain-content">
          <label class="range-block" for="ring-stage">猎环阶段<select id="ring-stage" v-model.number="ringIndex"><option v-for="(r,i) in rings.rings" :key="r.eventId" :value="i">第{{ r.ordinal }}环 · {{ r.requiredLevel }}级</option></select></label>
          <AnalysisChart title="本阶段可授环选项：基础吸收率" unit="%" :rows="selectedRing.choices.filter(c=>c.grantsRing).map(c=>({name:c.name,value:c.absorbChance*100}))" :series="[{key:'value',name:'吸收率'}]" description="需要战斗的选项在战胜后判定；特殊选项按实际魂环定义解析。第六环一次性淬炼不授环，不计吸收概率。"/>
          <AnalysisTable :caption="`第${selectedRing.ordinal}环 · 风险收益与实际定义`" :rows="selectedRing.choices" :columns="ringColumns"/>
          <div class="two-col"><AnalysisChart title="重复尝试：至少成功吸收一次" unit="%" kind="line" :rows="absorptionRows" label-key="attempts" :series="[{key:'low',name:'85%单次'},{key:'mid',name:'55%单次'},{key:'high',name:'20%单次'}]" description="每次都战胜、独立判定且同一吸收率；横轴尝试次数1—10。"/><div class="insight"><h3>期望次数 = 1 ÷ 吸收率</h3><p>85% → 1.18次；55% → 1.82次；20% → 5次。</p><p>若战斗胜率为w，一轮完整获得率为w×吸收率。实际总成本还包括战败、反噬与补给，不能直接用1/p当作游玩时长。</p></div></div>
          <AnalysisTable caption="九次突破总览：完整阶段与选项数" :rows="rings.rings.map(r=>({...r,options:r.choices.length,years:r.choices.map(c=>c.resolvedYear?format(c.resolvedYear)+'年':c.definitionName||'特殊定义').join(' / ')}))" :columns="[{key:'ordinal',label:'魂环'},{key:'requiredLevel',label:'门槛等级'},{key:'options',label:'选项数'},{key:'years',label:'可选年限/定义'}]"/>
        </div>
        <div v-else-if="active==='economy'" class="domain-content">
          <div class="mini-flow"><span>探索 / 战斗 / 签到</span><b>→</b><span>金币与经验</span><b>→</b><span>补给 / 旅行 / 伙伴</span><b>→</b><span>恢复与构筑</span><b>↺</b></div>
          <div class="two-col"><AnalysisChart title="七日签到基础奖励" unit="金币 / 经验（分别比较）" :rows="economy.dailyRewards.map(d=>({...d,name:`第${d.day}天`}))" :series="[{key:'gold',name:'金币'},{key:'exp',name:'经验'}]" description="不同资源不能相加折算价值；仅对照投放节奏。"/><div class="insight"><h3>七日投放总量</h3><strong>{{ format(economy.dailyTotals.gold) }} 金</strong><p>另有{{ format(economy.dailyTotals.exp) }}基础经验和第7天1点命运值。日期使用真实日历，旅行不推进签到。</p><p>休息：1次行动 → 40%最大生命 + 30%最大魂力。道具：金币 → 战斗中恢复机会。</p></div></div>
          <AnalysisTable caption="全商店：价格、效果与解锁" :rows="economy.shop" :columns="[{key:'name',label:'商品'},{key:'price',label:'售价/金币'},{key:'desc',label:'效果'},{key:'unlockLevel',label:'解锁等级'},{key:'efficiency',label:'恢复量/金币',format:(v,r)=>v===null?'随场景/非恢复品':`${format(v)} ${r.efficiencyUnit}`}]"/>
          <AnalysisChart title="同资源恢复效率" unit="恢复点 / 金币" :rows="economy.healingEfficiency.filter(r=>r.efficiency!==null).map(r=>({...r,heal:r.type==='heal'?r.efficiency:0,mp:r.type==='mp'?r.efficiency:0}))" :series="[{key:'heal',name:'生命恢复'},{key:'mp',name:'魂力恢复'}]" description="满血药价值随缺失生命变化；生命与魂力的效率不能直接比较强弱。"/>
          <AnalysisTable caption="经验丹购买边界：调用当前购买规则" :rows="purchaseRows" :columns="[{key:'name',label:'状态'},{key:'allowed',label:'是否可买'},{key:'reason',label:'实际结果'}]"/>
        </div>
        <div v-else-if="active==='build'" class="domain-content">
          <div class="formula">等级基础 → + 永久/魂环/魂骨/称号 → × 技能与兼容阵法 → + 伙伴关系 → 最终属性</div>
          <label class="range-block" for="attribute-level">只看武魂与等级基础：Lv.{{ attributeLevel }}<input id="attribute-level" v-model.number="attributeLevel" type="range" min="1" max="100"></label>
